title: Faust2Positive
---
<<declare $playerName = "Holder">>
<<gathervars>>
<<freezePlayer>>
You enter the gym and head to the wrestling room.

Faust is hitting a punching bag, focused.

The door shuts.

He looks up, and the cold look fades.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Hi, {$playerName}!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You wave and walk over.

He grabs a towel, wiping his face.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Good timing. I wanted to ask you something."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You: "Go on."

He drinks from his bottle and grins.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "I want to see how good you are now."
Faust: "Care to train with me?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

-> Game on
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump GameOn>>
-> Eh, okay
    <<jump EhOkay>>
-> No, that's not fair
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump NoNotFair>>
===

title: Faust2Negative
---
You enter the gym and see Faust training.

He hits the punching bag, focused.

The door shuts.

He looks up, expression softening.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Hi, {$playerName}!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You wave and walk over.

He wipes his face.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "How are you?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You: "I'm fine..."

He looks at you curiously.

You: "Actually, want a practice match?"

He lights up.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Of course!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

<<startEventGame>>
===

title: GameOn
---
You grin.

You: "Deal. Let's go."

He smirks, excited.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Game on."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

<<startEventGame>>
===

title: EhOkay
---
You hesitate.

You: "I guess I have time...okay."

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Nice."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

<<startEventGame>>
===

title: NoNotFair
---
You sigh.

You: "You're basically a pro. That's not fair."

He pouts.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Come on. It'll be good practice."
Faust: "I'll give pointers."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You give in.

You: "Fine."

<<startEventGame>>
===

title: PlayerWins
---
<<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
Your heart pounds.

'I...won?'

Faust is still on the ground.

He slowly stands, staring.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "You...won."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You nod, dazed.

He forces a smile.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "That was amazing."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He turns away.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "I'll get your answer."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He grabs it from his bag.

He returns and hands it over.

<<jump F2End>>
===

title: PlayerLoses
---
<<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
You hit the mat.

You: "Time! I said time!"

He laughs and steps back.

You breathe heavily.

He offers his hand.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Come on."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You take it. He pulls you up.

He walks you to a bench.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Your stance was weak."
Faust: "Keep your feet spread."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You sigh.

You: "I keep forgetting..."

He sits beside you and hands you water.

You drink gratefully.

He rummages in his bag.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Here. My answer."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You take it.

<<jump F2End>>
===

title: F2End
---
<<alterPlayerAttribute "Strength" 1>>
You: "Thanks."

He drinks water, then looks at you.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "No problem."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He looks relaxed.

You hand him the next question.

You gather your things.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Actually..."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You turn back.

He hesitates.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Want to meet tomorrow?"
Faust: "Just to hang out."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You: "That should be fine."

He smiles and nods.

You leave.

Something rushes past you.

It's Faust.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "It's a date then!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He laughs and disappears.

A date?

<<allowPlayerToMove>>
<<loadScene "CampusGrounds">>
===